    "detailed_description": "<h1>Experimental Games!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Call of Fries is a comical fries simulator. Fun physical arcade with drawn graphics and excellent music. <br>No blood - only ketchup!<br><br>Every potato dreams of getting in your mouth! But it's not that easy. There are always a lot of obstacles on the way. <br>Try to overcome all the traps and fill your stomach!<br><br>Here are some game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>intuitive mouse control,<br></li><li>no blood, just ketchup and mushrooms,<br></li><li>complex physical puzzles,<br></li><li>great music,<br></li><li>many interesting situations.</li></ul><br>It is highly recommended that you do not play on an empty stomach!",
